{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n今晚（4日）播出的《三代同糖》劇情超展開，容天佑飾演的霸道總裁高冠一，竟淪為何依婷的「阿四」！他在戀愛節目中被迫幫女友挽鞋，更在遊戲落敗後當眾潑沙兼爆粗，少爺仔脾氣大爆發，場面極度失控，究竟他與何依婷的關係會否因此亮起紅燈？\n</p>\n<h2>容天佑戀綜失控 潑沙爆粗勁失禮</h2>\n<p>在最新單元「少爺們的戀愛」中，高冠一（容天佑飾）為向前度的男友示威，一怒之下與女友朱圓圓（何依婷飾）參加戀愛綜藝節目。節目中他完全放下身段，不但要為何依婷拿行李，更要幫手挽高踭鞋，背後卻忍不住狂數對方：「一 Roll 機三分顏色上大紅，叫我拎完呢樣拎嗰樣，仲要我幫佢挽鞋！」其後在沙灘玩「三人扯大纜爭旗仔」遊戲時，因被對手聯手夾擊而落敗，他竟當場像小朋友般潑沙洩憤，再被前度（鍾晴飾）取笑是「軟腳蟹」後，更不顧鏡頭破口大罵，盡顯沉不住氣的少爺仔脾氣。</p>\n<h2>何依婷專業公關上身 急忙安撫解圍</h2>\n<p>面對男友容天佑在鏡頭前大發脾氣，飾演專業公關的何依婷即時上前溫柔安慰，努力化解現場的尷尬氣氛，表現專業。不過，滿腦子只想嫁入豪門的她，似乎未有察覺男友對她的種種不滿，事後只顧上網查看針對自己的負面留言，對二人的關係裂痕毫無警覺。這種只顧個人利益的表現，為她與容天佑的感情線埋下計時炸彈，隨時一觸即發。</p>\n<h2>歐瑞偉見何依婷一反常態 溫柔眼神藏伏線</h2>\n<p>劇集尾聲更驚現一大伏線！飾演KC的歐瑞偉在劇中向來只對樊亦敏恭恭敬敬，對其他人則極為嚴肅。然而，當他首次與何依婷飾演的朱圓圓碰面時，竟然全程笑容滿面，態度一百八十度轉變，眼神更流露出罕見的溫柔與欣賞之情。KC這突如其來的反常態度，不禁令觀眾猜測他與朱圓圓背後是否隱藏著不為人知的秘密關係，為劇情增添更多懸念。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議劇情反轉：霸道總裁變小朋友</h2>\n<p>劇集播出後，容天佑的「少爺仔」演出引起網民熱烈討論，輿論相當熱鬧。有網民笑指：「平時睇佢做霸道總裁好型，點知原來係個未大透嘅小朋友！」亦有人覺得角色真實：「呢啲富二代脾氣真係咁，一唔順意就發癲。」不過有觀眾更關心新伏線：「KC個眼神唔對路喎，同圓圓肯定有啲嘢！」更有網民期待：「想睇高冠一知道圓圓同KC有關係之後會有咩反應，肯定仲爆！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_16746805386aeabea8bfd3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_16746805386aeabea8bfd3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14888373336aeabead4aad5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14888373336aeabead4aad5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_2115856676aeabeb0a6f65.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_2115856676aeabeb0a6f65.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_3806836756aeabeb3d6abe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_3806836756aeabeb3d6abe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_4720768776aeabeb725d0d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_4720768776aeabeb725d0d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21366507926aeabebb2777d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21366507926aeabebb2777d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_17217028766aeabebdd72a9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_17217028766aeabebdd72a9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_5621872296aeabec0ec272.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_5621872296aeabec0ec272.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_10642665856aeabec450ccb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_10642665856aeabec450ccb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_10804319766aeabec7c2b86.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_10804319766aeabec7c2b86.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_11614059906aeabed1aeca6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_11614059906aeabed1aeca6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_18114913426aeabed509da6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_18114913426aeabed509da6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:26:00.643533+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1230,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:37.339701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:51.392997+00:00","content_hash":"e399607332b462427d4c887fc6471a43db270cac4df064e3ceea6556a869f4c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}